---
description: Working agreement for multi-file changes
alwaysApply: true
---

- Before editing more than one file, list the files you will touch and why, then proceed.
- `packages/legacy-clients` is retired and unused. Never edit it. `packages/web/dist` is build output. Never edit it.
- After changes, run `npm run typecheck` and report the result.
- Keep changes minimal. Do not refactor code the task did not ask you to touch.
